[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 111 The most expensive model Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.87,
    "end": 12.491,
    "zh": "第111课 最贵的型号 听录音,然后回答问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第111課 最貴的型號 聽錄音,然後回答問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Can Mr. Frith buy the television",
    "start": 13.597,
    "end": 17.178,
    "zh": "弗里斯先生能买那台电视机",
    "zh_hant": "弗里斯先生能買那臺電視機"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "on instalments?",
    "start": 17.019,
    "end": 18.999,
    "zh": "分期付款吗？",
    "zh_hant": "分期付款嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "How does it work?",
    "start": 19.74,
    "end": 21.581,
    "zh": "它是怎么运作的？",
    "zh_hant": "它是怎麼運作的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I like this television very much.",
    "start": 23.742,
    "end": 26.883,
    "zh": "我非常喜欢这台电视机。",
    "zh_hant": "我非常喜歡這臺電視機。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "How much does it cost?",
    "start": 27.224,
    "end": 29.585,
    "zh": "它多少钱？",
    "zh_hant": "它多少錢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "It's the most expensive model in the shop.",
    "start": 30.505,
    "end": 34.347,
    "zh": "这是店里最贵的型号。",
    "zh_hant": "這是店裡最貴的型號。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It costs five hundred pounds.",
    "start": 34.587,
    "end": 37.809,
    "zh": "它要五百英镑。",
    "zh_hant": "它要五百英鎊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "That's too expensive for us.",
    "start": 38.749,
    "end": 42.071,
    "zh": "这对我们来说太贵了。",
    "zh_hant": "這對我們來說太貴了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "We can't afford all that money.",
    "start": 42.252,
    "end": 45.413,
    "zh": "我们付不起那么多钱。",
    "zh_hant": "我們付不起那麼多錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "This model's less expensive than that one.",
    "start": 45.953,
    "end": 49.735,
    "zh": "这个型号比那个便宜。",
    "zh_hant": "這個型號比那個便宜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "It's only three hundred pounds.",
    "start": 50.036,
    "end": 52.897,
    "zh": "只要三百英镑。",
    "zh_hant": "只要三百英鎊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "But, of course,",
    "start": 52.957,
    "end": 54.798,
    "zh": "但是，当然，",
    "zh_hant": "但是，當然，"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "it's not as good as the expensive one.",
    "start": 54.678,
    "end": 58.68,
    "zh": "它不如那个贵的型号好。",
    "zh_hant": "它不如那個貴的型號好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I don't like this model.",
    "start": 60.08,
    "end": 62.381,
    "zh": "我不喜欢这个型号。",
    "zh_hant": "我不喜歡這個型號。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "The other model's more expensive,",
    "start": 62.742,
    "end": 65.803,
    "zh": "另一个型号更贵，",
    "zh_hant": "另一個型號更貴，"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "but it's worth the money.",
    "start": 65.983,
    "end": 68.344,
    "zh": "但它物有所值。",
    "zh_hant": "但它物有所值。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Can we buy it on instalments?",
    "start": 69.285,
    "end": 72.806,
    "zh": "我们可以分期付款买它吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我們可以分期付款買它嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Of course.",
    "start": 73.107,
    "end": 74.387,
    "zh": "当然可以。",
    "zh_hant": "當然可以。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "You can pay a deposit of thirty pounds,",
    "start": 74.548,
    "end": 78.549,
    "zh": "你可以先付三十英镑的定金，",
    "zh_hant": "你可以先付三十英鎊的定金，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "and then fourteen pounds a month",
    "start": 78.63,
    "end": 81.932,
    "zh": "然后每月付十四英镑",
    "zh_hant": "然後每月付十四英鎊"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "for three years.",
    "start": 81.832,
    "end": 83.553,
    "zh": "持续三年。",
    "zh_hant": "持續三年。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Do you like it, dear?",
    "start": 84.454,
    "end": 86.475,
    "zh": "你喜欢它吗，亲爱的？",
    "zh_hant": "你喜歡它嗎，親愛的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "I certainly do, but I",
    "start": 87.776,
    "end": 90.818,
    "zh": "我确实喜欢，但我",
    "zh_hant": "我確實喜歡，但我"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "don't like the price.",
    "start": 90.478,
    "end": 92.679,
    "zh": "不喜欢这个价格。",
    "zh_hant": "不喜歡這個價格。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "You always want the best,",
    "start": 93.0,
    "end": 95.941,
    "zh": "你总想要最好的，",
    "zh_hant": "你總想要最好的，"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "but we can't afford it.",
    "start": 95.962,
    "end": 98.443,
    "zh": "但我们买不起。",
    "zh_hant": "但我們買不起。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Sometimes you think",
    "start": 99.024,
    "end": 101.585,
    "zh": "有时候你觉得",
    "zh_hant": "有時候你覺得"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "you're a millionaire!",
    "start": 101.385,
    "end": 103.666,
    "zh": "自己是个百万富翁！",
    "zh_hant": "自己是個百萬富翁！"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "Millionaires don't buy things on instalments!",
    "start": 105.208,
    "end": 109.19,
    "zh": "百万富翁不买分期付款的东西！",
    "zh_hant": "百萬富翁不買分期付款的東西！"
  }
]
